        0.6689453125
      ],
      "radius": 0.055,
      "text": "The reception floor is open. The doors behind the counter and the service door remain closed. If you have Watch business, speak to the clerk first. I am here to keep the doorway clear."
    },
    {
      "id": "notices",
      "kind": "examine",
      "title": "Public notices",
      "stand": [
        0.2734375,
        0.4765625
